\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The four phases of the Anchor Protocol. Each phase is a refinement of the previous: the cryptographic primitive changes, the property strengthens, and a specific threat is foreclosed. The teal pill on each arrow records \emph  {why} the next phase was forced --- not as historical narrative but as a constructive argument that no earlier phase suffices on its own. Phases 1--3 are mechanized in ProVerif (\S  \ref {app:mech}); Phase 4 is enforced at runtime against monotonicity and reanimation invariants (\S  \ref {sec:revocation}).}}{4}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:anchor-four-phases}{{1}{4}{The four phases of the Anchor Protocol. Each phase is a refinement of the previous: the cryptographic primitive changes, the property strengthens, and a specific threat is foreclosed. The teal pill on each arrow records \emph {why} the next phase was forced --- not as historical narrative but as a constructive argument that no earlier phase suffices on its own. Phases 1--3 are mechanized in ProVerif (\S \ref {app:mech}); Phase 4 is enforced at runtime against monotonicity and reanimation invariants (\S \ref {sec:revocation})}{figure.caption.2}{}}
