\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Cuckoo-filter revocation gate (Fan et al.~\cite  {fan2014cuckoo}) with the load-factor ceiling that defeats the pollution attack. Insert lands at either of two candidate buckets $i_1, i_2 = i_1 \oplus h(\mathrm  {fp})$; on full, evict and re-insert at the kicked fingerprint's alternate. Insert rejection at $0.95$ caps occupancy inside the regime where the false-positive bound holds.}}{8}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:anchor-cuckoo-inline}{{5}{8}{Cuckoo-filter revocation gate (Fan et al.~\cite {fan2014cuckoo}) with the load-factor ceiling that defeats the pollution attack. Insert lands at either of two candidate buckets $i_1, i_2 = i_1 \oplus h(\mathrm {fp})$; on full, evict and re-insert at the kicked fingerprint's alternate. Insert rejection at $0.95$ caps occupancy inside the regime where the false-positive bound holds}{figure.caption.7}{}}
